#. Tag: title
#: using.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using &kpercentage;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:4
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The welcome window lets you choose the type of exercise by clicking on one "
"of the buttons. The buttons are labeled with the value to be deduced in the "
"exercises."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: using.docbook:9
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<screeninfo>Here's a screenshot of the &kpercentage; welcome window</"
"screeninfo>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: using.docbook:15
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<phrase>Here's a screenshot of the &kpercentage; welcome window</phrase>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: using.docbook:21
#, no-c-format
msgid "More &kpercentage; features"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:23
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On the left hand the number of exercises can be selected. One can choose "
"from 1 to 10 tasks."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:26
#, no-c-format
msgid "On the right hand you can change the level of difficulty:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: using.docbook:30
#, no-c-format
msgid "Easy"
msgstr "Aisit"

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:32
#, no-c-format
msgid "Only percentages with easy to calculate values are given."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: using.docbook:37
#, no-c-format
msgid "Medium"
msgstr "Mejan"

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:39
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Harder percentages are included, even some with values greater than 100%"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: using.docbook:45
#, no-c-format
msgid "Crazy"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:47
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Any percentage up to 200% may occur. All values are whole numbered however, "
"so be honest, calculate them in your head!"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are some help functions integrated. As usual some tool tips arise when "
"the mouse is over a control element like a button or an edit line. If you "
"click on the <guibutton>Help</guibutton> button, a little menu pops up with "
"further opportunities:"
msgstr ""

